record.body:
@apirrone Thanks, glad it's useful. Happy to send a full set of policies. I'm switching machines shortly, so I should be able to get them to you within the coming month.

One thing to keep in mind for the test: the policies I have now come from 3000 iteration runs, so they walk but don't have the margin of a full run. I'll retrain properly before sending.

Any preference on the format: ONNX exports only, or checkpoints as well? And is there anything specific you want covered on the robots so I can make sure the runs match?

